cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "SPINDEP: Spin-Dependent Exotic Interaction Analysis Framework"
abstract: >-
  A Python framework for comparing matter and antimatter coupling-constant
  bounds on spin-dependent exotic interactions, classified by the
  Dobrescu–Mocioiu potentials (V1–V16), and testing their consistency with
  CPT symmetry via an asymmetry parameter and chi-squared significance tests.
